# The checks of the parent directory, with one disabled on purpose for the benchmarks:
#   clang-analyzer-cplusplus.NewDeleteLeaks  Google Benchmark 1.8 (Ubuntu 24.04) registers a benchmark by handing a
#                                            pointer from new to its registry, which the analyzer reports as a leak
#                                            inside benchmark.h. Version 1.9 hands it a unique_ptr.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -clang-analyzer-cplusplus.NewDeleteLeaks
